# Read by BuildKit because it sits beside the Dockerfile; a .dockerignore in this directory
# would not be, since the context is the repo root. Without it the weights are the context.
# tests/ stays in: the parity stage runs the guard inside the build.
**/models/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.coverage
run/
docs/
specs/
packages/golibs/
packages/pylibs/*/tests/
deployment/
services/*
!services/*/pyproject.toml
!services/inferences-system-one/
# The last matching pattern wins, so the re-include above undoes the ** exclusions for this
# service: they are repeated here, after it. Without them the context is the weights, the graph
# and the export's torch venv (2.9 GB), and host .pyc files reach the image.
services/inferences-system-one/README.md
services/inferences-system-one/models/
services/inferences-system-one/**/__pycache__/
services/inferences-system-one/**/*.pyc
services/inferences-system-one/.coverage
.claude/
.github/
.git/
